            "step": 1,
            "latex": "\\left[f(x) \\cdot g(x)^{-1}\\right]' = f'(x)g(x)^{-1} + f(x) \\cdot (-1)g(x)^{-2}g'(x)",
            "note": "套用乘法法则、幂函数求导与链式法则",
